message: "If you use UI Iceberg in research, benchmarks, or technical writing, please cite this software."
title: "UI Iceberg"
type: software
version: "0.4.0"
date-released: "2026-09-06"
authors:
  - name: "@cyrillesaxo"
    website: "https://github.com/cyrillesaxo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cyrillesaxo/ICEBERG"
url: "https://cyrillesaxo.github.io/ICEBERG/"
license: "Apache-2.0"
abstract: >-
  UI Iceberg is open-source UI journey assurance and test-scenario intelligence.
  It generates bounded journey scenarios, maps them against existing tests,
  checks apparent green evidence for bounded deceptive-witness distortions,
  preserves unknown or weak evidence instead of normalizing it to pass, and
  adds scoped admission plus change-reactivation primitives for AI agents.
keywords:
  - ui testing
  - journey assurance
  - test scenarios
  - deceptive witness
  - evidence admission
  - change reactivation
  - Playwright
  - MCP
  - AI coding agents
  - quality assurance
notes: "Created by @cyrillesaxo and published by Dodo LLC."
